{"title":"Precalculus","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Precalculus is a teaches the algebra and trig needed for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calculus\" title=\"Calculus\">calculus</a>. Some topics in precalculus involve conic sections, sequences and series, and complex numbers, but don't have any actual calculus topics like limits or derivatives. A solid understanding of algebra is mandatory for calculus, and that's what this provides.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Precalculus&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Precalculus_by_AoPS\" title=\"Precalculus by AoPS\">Precalculus by AoPS</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Precalculus&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.278      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.278      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:29117:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172003 and revision id 259771. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}